   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Legal Assistance Consortium (ILAC) supports the system of rule of law in countries, with a focus on countries affected by or at risk of violent conflict. Sida supports ILAC with a core support to improve justice systems, for instance the training of judges.</narrative>
